{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ocaml","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"OCaml","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for OCaml (.ml .mli .mll .mly).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ocaml","name":"OCaml","extensions":[".ml",".mli",".mll",".mly"],"grammar":"grammars/ocaml.json","blockComment":["(*","*)"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"OCaml","path":"snippets/ocaml.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ocaml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\(\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|<-|::|\\\\|>\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:initializer|constraint|exception|external|function|functor|include|inherit|mutable|private|virtual|assert|downto|method|module|nonrec|object|struct|begin|class|match|while|done|else|lazy|open|then|type|when|with|and|end|for|fun|let|new|rec|sig|try|val|as|do|if|in|of|or|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:string|option|float|array|bool|char|unit|list|int|ref|exn)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:print_endline|Printf\\\\.printf|print_string|print_int|failwith|ignore|raise)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ocaml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let ${1:name} ${2:x} =\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Recursive function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"letrec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"let rec ${1:name} ${2:x} =\",\n      \"  $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A recursive function\"\n  },\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"match ${1:x} with\",\n      \"| ${2:pattern} -> $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"match\"\n  },\n  \"Type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:t} =\",\n      \"  | ${2:A}\",\n      \"  | ${3:B}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variant type\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# OCaml\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for OCaml.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ml`, `.mli`, `.mll`, `.mly`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `let` | A function |\n| `letrec` | A recursive function |\n| `match` | match |\n| `type` | A variant type |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}